+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,1861 +0,0 @@
-/*
-Distributed under both the W3C Test Suite License [1] and the W3C
-3-clause BSD License [2]. To contribute to a W3C Test Suite, see the
-policies and contribution forms [3].
-
