-
-This test verifies that composited scrollbars update correctly when removed and
-reinserted with a different content size.<br><br>
-
-It passes if both boxes have identical scrollbars.<br><br>
-
-<div class="box">
-    <div id="space1"></div>
-</div>
-<div class="box">
-    <div id="space2"></div>
-</div>
